OL,3,GNEWSAButcher blames costs for closure
OL,4,Aafter 127 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family butcher's shop has blamed
OL,7,Frising costs as it prepares to close
OL,8,Flater after 127 years.
OL,10,FBennett Butchers, in Spalding,
OL,11,FLincolnshire, was opened by Henry
OL,12,FBennett in 1899 and is now owned by
OL,13,FAndrew Parsons, his great-grandson.
OL,15,FParsons said the shop in Winsover Road
OL,16,Fwas still popular and profitable, but a
OL,17,Fnumber of issues meant its future was
OL,18,F"unviable".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
