OL,3,GNEWSAButcher blames costs for closure
OL,4,Aafter 127 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're a labour-intensive business.
OL,7,FWe're also high energy users. The hike
OL,8,Fin National Insurance from the
OL,9,Fgovernment last year and all these
OL,10,F[things], they all make it very, very
OL,11,Fdifficult," he added.
